<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA 239-7 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 239-7 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India made 239 for 7 in their 50 overs Asia Cup cricket final against Sri Lanka at Colombo's R.Premadasa Stadium on Saturday.</p>
